-> Tutorial step 1: an order for a small shop. `Particle` is the
-> predefined base every particle type builds on (`_class`/`_created`);
-> `∩` merges it with the field constraints that name this particular set
-> of objects.
Order = Particle ∩ { _class ∈ "Order", item ∈ String, quantity ∈ Number, unit_price ∈ Number }

first = Order { item = "Coffee", quantity = 3, unit_price = 4.5 }
assert first.item = "Coffee"
assert first.quantity = 3
